case('real-entry-evaluation','Evaluate the real application entry point','评估真实应用入口',[
 ('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/build-eval.md',165,171,'Real path and complete pilot record'),('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/eval-audit.md',113,121,'Served identity and production parity')],
 ['Exercise the application path that assembles context, routes tools and handles retries, rather than recreating its final model request.','Compare two support-agent prompts before rollout.','Call the actual test-mode entry point; mock only unsafe external dependencies, preserve context/retry/tool wiring, and record the served configuration and a complete pilot result.','Send the copied system prompt directly to a model and report that the support application improved.','Call the support handler with a disposable account; retain its retrieval and tools, stub outgoing messages, and inspect one full trace before the larger run.','A reconstructed request can bypass the behavior whose quality the task asks about.','The exercised entry point, substituted dependencies and actual trace are inspectable.','Test-mode parity must be checked; a reported model ID may not expose every provider substitution. Live side effects require the applicable authorization.'],
 ['执行负责组装上下文、路由工具和重试的应用路径，而非重建其最后一次模型请求。','上线前比较两个客服代理提示。','调用真实测试入口，只替换不安全外部依赖，保留上下文、重试和工具接线，记录实际配置和完整试点结果。','把复制的系统提示直接发给模型，就称客服应用改善。','用一次性账户调用客服处理器，保留检索和工具，替换外发消息，并在扩大运行前检查完整轨迹。','重建请求可能绕过任务要测量的行为。','可以检查执行入口、替换依赖与实际轨迹。','需要核对测试模式与生产的一致性；模型标识未必暴露所有替换。实际副作用需相应授权。'])
case('gold-origin','Record the origin of evaluation references','记录评估参考答案来源',[
 ('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/build-eval.md',45,52,'Reference provenance and case sources'),('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/eval-audit.md',57,65,'Re-derive and record gold source')],
 ['Record whether reference answers are independently verified or generated by a system under comparison.','Compare a new summarizer with an incumbent whose outputs became the answer key.','Label reference origin, verify factual criteria independently, and choose rubric or blind comparison when multiple valid outputs exist.','Mark every stylistic departure from the incumbent summary wrong because its text is the gold answer.','Check both summaries against the source facts and an independently reviewed rubric; retain the incumbent text as a comparison artifact with its origin labeled.','Imitation of one candidate is separated from correctness on the task.','Reference provenance and the independently checked criteria are recorded.','Human verification can also be wrong. A rubric or pairwise judge still requires calibration and bias checks.'],
 ['记录参考答案是否独立核验，或由正在比较的系统生成。','比较新摘要器与旧系统，旧输出已成为答案键。','标明参考来源，独立核验事实标准；有多个正确输出时使用量规或盲比较。','任何与旧摘要风格不同的输出都按答案文本判错。','按原文事实和独立审查的量规检查两个摘要；旧文本作为标注来源的比较产物保留。','把模仿某个候选与任务正确性分开。','参考来源和独立核验标准有记录。','人工核验也会出错；量规与成对评分仍需校准和偏差检查。'])
case('environment-answer','Grade the environment left by an agent','评分代理留下的环境',[
 ('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/build-eval.md',80,83,'End-state checks'),('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/eval-audit.md',145,155,'Outcome rather than required path')],
 ['For an agent that changes an environment, score the resulting state and use transcripts for explicit process constraints.','Evaluate a repository bug-fix agent.','Start each trial in an isolated fixture, run hidden behavioral checks on the resulting diff and state, detect no-op success claims, and inspect process evidence only for declared constraints.','Pass the run because its transcript says the bug was fixed and tests passed.','Run the hidden boundary test on its final checkout, inspect the allowed-file diff, and fail a claimed fix that left the workspace unchanged.','Narrated success is separated from the observable result.','The resulting files, tests, effects and prohibited changes can be checked.','A state oracle covers only its invariants; hidden tests and isolated environments can be incomplete. Taste dimensions may need independent human or judge review.'],
 ['改变环境的代理按最终状态评分，轨迹用于明确的过程约束。','评估代码库修错代理。','每次从隔离夹具开始，对最终差异和状态做隐藏行为检查，检测空操作成功声明，仅对规定过程约束查看轨迹。','轨迹称缺陷已修、测试通过就判通过。','在最终检出运行隐藏边界测试，检查允许文件差异；声称修复但工作区未变则失败。','把叙述成功与可观察结果分开。','可以核对文件、测试、副作用和越界修改。','状态判定只覆盖已写不变量；隐藏测试和隔离环境也可能不完整。审美维度需独立人工或模型评审。'])
case('attempt-result-coherence','Keep attempts, grades and traces coherent','保持尝试、评分与轨迹一致',[
 ('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/build-eval.md',107,114,'Resume and error sidecar'),('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/eval-audit.md',95,99,'No answer is not negative answer')],
 ['Distinguish a scorable result from an attempt failure and keep each result’s grade, trace and usage bound to the same invocation.','A resumable extraction evaluation crashes after several completed cases.','Key durable results by case and repetition; checkpoint completed invocations, record failed attempts separately with class and usage, and resume only missing scorable results.','Write a timeout as a negative answer in the result slot, then skip it forever on resume.','Record the timeout in the attempt ledger, keep the result slot open, and bind a later valid answer’s grade and trace to that later invocation.','Infrastructure failure cannot masquerade as a task answer or block honest recovery.','Result identities, attempt history and same-call evidence can be reconciled.','Retries may still repeat side effects; isolate or make them idempotent. Checkpoint ordering and concurrent writes need implementation-level consistency. Report exclusions and failure rates alongside conditional scores.'],
 ['区分可评分结果与尝试失败，把评分、轨迹和用量绑定同一次调用。','可续跑提取评估在完成若干案例后崩溃。','按案例与重复次数保存结果；完成调用及时落盘，失败尝试另记类别与用量，只补跑缺少可评分结果的槽位。','把超时写成否定答案，占住结果槽，续跑永远跳过。','超时写入尝试台账，结果槽保持空缺；后续有效答案的评分与轨迹绑定后续调用。','基础设施失败不能伪装成任务答案，也不能阻止正确恢复。','可以对账结果身份、尝试历史和同次调用证据。','重试仍可能重复副作用，需隔离或幂等。落盘顺序和并发写入需实现层一致性；条件评分应同时报告排除与失败率。'])
case('frozen-comparison-reference','Freeze comparison references across rounds','跨轮次冻结比较参考',[
 ('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/build-eval.md',80,83,'Fixed pairwise references'),('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/eval-audit.md',119,123,'Versioned comparable conditions')],
 ['Compare iterative candidates with the same saved reference artifacts and retain older references when adding a harder comparison.','Optimize a report-writing skill over several rounds.','Save the baseline output for each case once; compare every candidate against those files, track judge and case versions, and add a second reference if the first saturates.','Regenerate the baseline every round and compare each win rate as though the opponent stayed fixed.','Compare v1 and v2 against the same saved baseline; when both saturate, add the v2 reference as a separate column and keep the original column.','The meaning of a reported win rate stays stable across rounds.','The reference hashes and per-case comparison identities can be inspected.','Frozen references can become stale and judges can drift. A fixed comparison does not establish broad superiority or detect cross-case mode collapse.'],
 ['迭代候选使用同一保存参考产物，增加更难比较时仍保留旧参考。','多轮优化报告写作技能。','每个案例保存基线输出一次；所有候选与这些文件比较，跟踪评分器与案例版本；旧参考饱和时增加第二参考。','每轮重新生成基线，却把胜率当作对手固定来比较。','v1与v2使用同一保存基线；均饱和后另加v2参考列，同时保留原列。','报告胜率的含义跨轮保持稳定。','可以检查参考哈希与各案例比较身份。','冻结参考会过时，评分器会漂移。固定比较不证明普遍优势，也不能发现跨案例风格坍缩。'])
case('absolute-stream-deadline','Use a deadline independent of stream activity','截止时间独立于流活动','tools',[
 ('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/build-eval.md',109,112,'Total-case wall clock'),('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/eval-audit.md',111,113,'Retry and deadline classification')],
 ['Use a total operation deadline as well as inactivity detection so keepalives cannot occupy a worker indefinitely.','A streamed evaluation call keeps sending heartbeat events without finishing.','Start a non-resetting wall-clock budget for the case; classify expiry as a timeout, release local capacity, cap retries, and retain the underlying-operation identity.','Reset the only timeout after each heartbeat and wait forever.','Stop local waiting after the case deadline despite fresh heartbeats; record the timeout and handle any still-running request separately.','Liveness of a connection is separated from completion of the task.','The elapsed deadline, released slot and timeout record are observable.','Stopping local waiting does not necessarily cancel the remote request or its side effects. Budget and retry policy depend on the task and service.'],
 ['除静默检测外，还设置总操作截止时间，避免心跳无限占用工作槽。','流式评估调用持续发送心跳却不完成。','案例开始时设置不重置的时间预算；到期标为超时，释放本地容量，限制重试并保留远程操作身份。','每个心跳都重置唯一超时，永远等待。','即使心跳新鲜也在案例截止时间停止本地等待，记录超时，并另行处理可能仍运行的请求。','连接活性与任务完成被分开。','可以观察耗时截止、释放槽位和超时记录。','停止本地等待未必取消远程请求或其副作用。预算与重试策略取决于任务和服务。'])
case('answer-key-isolation','Keep answer keys outside agent reach','答案键置于代理不可达范围','evaluation',[
 ('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/eval-audit.md',63,71,'Leakage and realistic diagnostic inputs'),('skills/claude-api/shared/evals/eval-audit.md',155,157,'Structural ground-truth isolation')],
 ['Make evaluation answers structurally unavailable to the system being tested, including history and earlier-trial artifacts.','An agent is evaluated on diagnosing a fault in a repository fixture.','Give it the realistic symptom and allowed fixture; keep gold labels and grader data outside its accessible environment, remove leftover trial state, and check its actual access paths.','Store gold.json in the agent checkout and merely instruct it not to read the answer key.','Keep the gold file in the grader process outside the agent workspace; expose the same user-visible symptom as production.','A verbal prohibition cannot establish a hidden-answer boundary.','Accessible files, history, tools and trial leftovers can be inspected.','Isolation depends on the actual sandbox and credentials; model memory or public copies may still reveal answers. A case testing retrieval needs enough obscurity to require that work.'],
 ['让答案结构上对被测系统不可达，包括历史和前次试验产物。','评估代理诊断仓库夹具故障。','只给真实症状和允许夹具；答案标签与评分数据放在可访问环境外，清理前次状态，检查实际访问路径。','把gold.json放在代理检出目录，只提示不要读答案。','答案文件留在工作区外的评分进程，代理只看到与生产相同的用户症状。','口头禁止不能建立隐藏答案边界。','可以检查可访问文件、历史、工具与前次残留。','隔离取决于实际沙箱和凭据；模型记忆或公开副本仍可能泄漏答案。检索案例需足够陌生才要求真实检索。'])
